   households and field visits were made, more than 90\% of the
   interviewees, he was very satisfied with the quality of the water
   service, 50\% indicated that he made the separation of solid waste and
   94\% said that he saved water. 100\% of gray water from homes is
   discharged directly into stormwater collectors without treatment. In the
   case of sewage, 89\% of homes use septic tanks with drainage area.},
